### Basic installation

```bash
conda create -n reservoir_benchmark python=3.11 -y
conda activate reservoir_benchmark
python -m pip install -e .
This installs the basic dependencies required by DP, SDP, ISO-SURF, data processing, evaluation, and visualization modules.


If you want to run DQN-based experiments, install the optional DQN dependencies:
python -m pip install -e ".[dqn]"
python -m pip install -e ".[dqn]"